{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷被困的预兆"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["“人子啊，你去拿一块砖放在自己面前，把耶路撒冷城画在上面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["然后围困这城，建垒筑台，扎营围攻，四面架起撞城锤。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["拿一个铁盘当作铁墙放在你和城中间。你要面向这城，围困攻击这城。这是给以色列人的一个征兆。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["“你要向左侧卧，担当以色列人的罪恶。要用你向左侧卧的天数担当以色列人的罪恶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他们犯罪多少年，我要让你侧卧多少天。你要担当以色列人的罪恶三百九十天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["然后，你再向右侧卧，担当犹大的罪恶四十天。你侧卧的天数代表他们犯罪的年数。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你要面向被围困的耶路撒冷，光着臂膀说预言斥责这城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我要用绳索捆绑你，使你不能翻身，直到你围城的日子期满。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["“你要拿小麦、大麦、豆、扁豆、小米和粗麦，装在一个器皿中用来为自己做饼。你在三百九十天侧卧期间要吃这饼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["你每天要按时按量吃二百克，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["每天要按时按量喝六百毫升水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你要像吃大麦饼一样吃这些饼，要在众人面前用人粪来烤饼。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和华说：“我把以色列人驱逐到各国的时候，他们也要这样在那里吃不洁净的食物。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我说：“唉，主耶和华啊！我从来没有玷污过自己，我自幼至今从未吃过自然死去的或被野兽撕碎的动物，不洁净的肉从未入过我的口。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["于是祂对我说：“好吧，我容许你用牛粪代替人粪来烤饼。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["祂又说：“人子啊，我要断绝耶路撒冷的粮源，叫他们怀着焦虑限量吃饼，怀着恐惧限量喝水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他们必缺粮少水，绝望地面面相觑，因自己的罪恶而灭亡。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}